OL,3,GNEWSACyclists descend on Scottish
OL,4,ABorders for two major racing events
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of amateur cyclists and some
OL,7,Fof the world's top professionals are
OL,8,Ftaking to the road in the Scottish
OL,9,FBorders.
OL,11,FTwo major events are taking place later
OL,12,Fin the region, which is set to host the
OL,13,FTour de France next year.
OL,15,FThe final stage of the elite Tour of
OL,16,FBritain men's race is being held on a
OL,17,Fcircular route, beginning and ending at
OL,18,FEarlston.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
