OL,3,GNEWSACyclists descend on Scottish
OL,4,ABorders for two major racing events
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same time, riders will come from
OL,7,Facross the UK and beyond to test
OL,8,Fthemselves in the Tour O The Borders
OL,9,Fwhich starts and finishes in Peebles.
OL,10,FThe two routes do not overlap.
